<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44843" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔποτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίνω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>easy to drink, pleasant to the taste</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥέος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					676
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				812
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδωρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.Med.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
			</span></i>inc.<i><span class="en">
				23.15
			</span></i>; of milk, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				611
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>good to drink from</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκπώματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eratosth.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				11.482b
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>accustomed to drink</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>CA</u>
				2.3
			</span></i>.</div>
